  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2000401",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Goth",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200040101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200040101": {
            "id": "200040101",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "*sigh* I suppose I might have to sort this out myself...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040102"
            ]
          },
          "200040102": {
            "id": "200040102",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "Ack, these old bones will fall apart at this rate...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040103"
            ]
          },
          "200040103": {
            "id": "200040103",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is there some urgent matter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040104"
            ]
          },
          "200040104": {
            "id": "200040104",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "Oh, Traveler? Well, this... I wouldn't call it \"an urgent matter,\" but it is getting out of hand for sure...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040105"
            ]
          },
          "200040105": {
            "id": "200040105",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "As you know, those Fatui have my hotel fully booked.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040106"
            ]
          },
          "200040106": {
            "id": "200040106",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "And as you know, I, as the boss of the Goth Grand Hotel, have to attend to them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040107"
            ]
          },
          "200040107": {
            "id": "200040107",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "I coordinate food catering, repairs, and a slew of miscellaneous matters besides.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040108"
            ]
          },
          "200040108": {
            "id": "200040108",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "Lately, some rooms have had their furniture damaged, so I've had to contact people to bring the appropriate timber to some carpenters.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040109"
            ]
          },
          "200040109": {
            "id": "200040109",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "Then there's the matter of collecting rent on a few apartments... and the matter of my lad Marvin being nowhere to be found.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040110"
            ]
          },
          "200040110": {
            "id": "200040110",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "*sigh* I wonder how long I can last... Or when that boy will finally grow up...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040113"
            ]
          },
          "200040113": {
            "id": "200040113",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "You're willing to help? Ah, that's wonderful! ... *sigh* If only that loud Marvin had as good a head on his shoulders as you. That would've spared me much trouble...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040114"
            ]
          },
          "200040114": {
            "id": "200040114",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "In that case, could I trouble you to fetch some Fir Wood and Birch Wood? I'll need to have them sent to the carpenters soon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2000406",
      "subQuestName": "Give Goth the timber",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200040601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200040601": {
            "id": "200040601",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "Have you obtained the timber? I just need one set of Fir Wood and another of Birch Wood."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2000407",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Goth",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200040701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200040701": {
            "id": "200040701",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "Thank you so much. These should do. Now to send them off to the carpenter... Oh. Right! I need to collect rent as well...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040702"
            ]
          },
          "200040702": {
            "id": "200040702",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "*sigh* I just wonder if that... As... Astromona, or whatever she was called, will be in this time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040703"
            ]
          },
          "200040703": {
            "id": "200040703",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It's Mona Megistus, the Astrologist.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040704"
            ]
          },
          "200040704": {
            "id": "200040704",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "Right! Yes, that was her name... Ugh. It's a bit long, if you ask me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040705"
            ]
          },
          "200040705": {
            "id": "200040705",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Mona hasn't paid her rent, you say?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040706"
            ]
          },
          "200040706": {
            "id": "200040706",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "Well, that's just the thing, see? All my other tenants have already paid theirs. She's the only one left.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040707"
            ]
          },
          "200040707": {
            "id": "200040707",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "I came by a few times previously, but she wasn't in.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040708"
            ]
          },
          "200040708": {
            "id": "200040708",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "So please, Traveler, help me go down there and urge her to pay up soon, would you?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2000402",
      "subQuestName": "Pay Mona a visit",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2000403",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Mona",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200040301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200040301": {
            "id": "200040301",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Ah, it's you. It's been a while.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040302"
            ]
          },
          "200040302": {
            "id": "200040302",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Strange, you seem to be in a hurry. Were you looking for me, by any chance?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040303"
            ]
          },
          "200040303": {
            "id": "200040303",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Where have you been, Mona?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040304"
            ]
          },
          "200040304": {
            "id": "200040304",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We've been looking for you these last few days.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040305"
            ]
          },
          "200040305": {
            "id": "200040305",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Oh, that was... rather inopportune of you. A few days ago, The Steambird sent me a request for a new manuscript.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040306"
            ]
          },
          "200040306": {
            "id": "200040306",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "The topic in question was \"celestial shifts and their relation to a person's changing fates.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040307"
            ]
          },
          "200040307": {
            "id": "200040307",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "As such, I have largely been out studying the stars these past couple of days, only returning well after dark.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040308"
            ]
          },
          "200040308": {
            "id": "200040308",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Looks like Mona's working for that Mora...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040309"
            ]
          },
          "200040309": {
            "id": "200040309",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "W—Well, I mean, there's this new celestial globe from Fontaine that I've put down an order for. I've even paid the deposit already.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040310"
            ]
          },
          "200040310": {
            "id": "200040310",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Once I get the Mora from submitting this manuscript, I should be able to settle the balance and claim the celestial globe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040311"
            ]
          },
          "200040311": {
            "id": "200040311",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, don't forget about your rent payment to Goth...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040312"
            ]
          },
          "200040312": {
            "id": "200040312",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Rent?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040313"
            ]
          },
          "200040313": {
            "id": "200040313",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Oh! I, um... Surely, I've put some Mora aside for this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040314"
            ]
          },
          "200040314": {
            "id": "200040314",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Give me a moment...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040315"
            ]
          },
          "200040315": {
            "id": "200040315",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Mona rifles through her purse...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040316"
            ]
          },
          "200040316": {
            "id": "200040316",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "These here... and these! There, that should cover it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040317"
            ]
          },
          "200040317": {
            "id": "200040317",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(She's practically emptied her pockets here...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040318"
            ]
          },
          "200040318": {
            "id": "200040318",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Right, then. Help me pass this Mora to Goth, would you?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2000404",
      "subQuestName": "Give the rent to Goth",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200040401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200040401": {
            "id": "200040401",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "How did it go? Were you able to find that Ast... Well, your friend?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040402"
            ]
          },
          "200040402": {
            "id": "200040402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Here's the rent.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040403"
            ]
          },
          "200040403": {
            "id": "200040403",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "Ah, good, good. This will do. Thank you very much.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040404"
            ]
          },
          "200040404": {
            "id": "200040404",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "That said, might I ask what it is that your friend does for a living?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040405"
            ]
          },
          "200040405": {
            "id": "200040405",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "She seems like the capable sort, and yet she always appears short on Mora..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2000405",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Mona",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200040501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200040501": {
            "id": "200040501",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "You're back. I assume Goth has been paid?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040502"
            ]
          },
          "200040502": {
            "id": "200040502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That he has.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040503"
            ]
          },
          "200040503": {
            "id": "200040503",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "That's good. Thankfully, the rent on this house isn't particularly expensive. I was just barely able to scrounge up the necessary Mora as things stood.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200040504"
            ]
          },
          "200040504": {
            "id": "200040504",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "That said, I suppose I'll be subsisting on salad for a few more days..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2000409",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200040901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200040901": {
            "id": "200040901",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "There isn't much left on the food budget. Good thing I made a few more servings of salad yesterday..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2000410",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200041001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200041001": {
            "id": "200041001",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "As... Astro... Hmm, what was her name again?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2000411",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200041101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200041101": {
            "id": "200041101",
            "speakerId": 1606,
            "speakerName": "Goth",
            "text": "All the rent has been collected. I suppose I can rest for a while now..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}